Section 17: Academy of Scientific and Innovative Research, 2011
The Academy of Scientific and Innovative Research, 2011
17. Powers of Board.-
(1) The Board is responsible for overseeing, directing, and controlling the affairs of the Academy and has the authority to review the actions of the Senate.
(2) In addition, the Board has the authority to:
a) Make decisions regarding the administration and operation of the Academy;
b) Introduce educational programs at the Academy;
c) Establish regulations;
