SECTION 2 of Coal Mines Provident Fund and Miscellaneous Provisions Act, 1948
The Coal Mines Provident Fund and Miscellaneous Provisions Act, 1948
2. Interpretation.-
In this Act, unless there is anything repugnant in the subject or context,-
(a) "bonus" means any sum of money payable to an 8[employee] under the Coal Mines Bonus Scheme framed under this Act;
9[(aa) "coal" includes lignite;]
